{"id":"u-fad860cc-031c-430a-b89f-2733cdf40bb7","src":"community","title":"SAITAMA S3","author":"Julio F.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/R7QDAF-saitama-s2-1","desc":"Welcome to the SAITAMA upper-lower Hypertrophy program.\n\nSTAGE 3\n\nIf you have done things right, you have been training for about 6-12 months & you are close to being an intermediate.\nProgression has probably slow down or even stalled.\n\nEXERCISE SELECTION \n\nIf something is progressin well and you have no aches don`t change it.\nAlthough I think it's a good time to include some variation.\n\n\nINTENSITY\n\nIt's time to take it up a notch. \nBy now you have some practice on the compound lifts, & you have been training decently hard.\nYou can try to go to failure/RIR 0 on compound lifts.\nI recommend doing it only on the last set for each muscle group.\nYou don't have to do it every week.\nI don't recommend going to failure on Squats or Deadlifts/Rdls.\n\nPROGRESSION\n\n\n\nREST INTERVALS\n\n3-4 min between compounds.\n1-2 min between isolations.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T03:44:27.386Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["UPPER A","LOWER A","UPPER B","LOWER B"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":6,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Neck Curl","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":20,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":3}]}]},{"n":"Barbell Row","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":8,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":3}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":3}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Concentration Curl","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bench Finger Wrist Curl","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":3}]}]}]},{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"High Bar Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo